OL,3,GNEWSAResorts' parking revenue down
OL,4,Adespite busy summer
OL,5,
OL,6,FIncome from parking charges has been
OL,7,Flower than expected, despite strong
OL,8,Fvisitor numbers during the hot summer,
OL,9,FBournemouth Christchurch and Poole
OL,10,F(BCP) Council figures show.
OL,12,FThe council said visitors appear to
OL,13,Fhave had spent less time and money in
OL,14,Fthe resorts, with parking income 7%
OL,15,Flower than predicted.
OL,17,FA recently published report showed that
OL,18,Fthe council was forecasting a #27m
OL,19,Foverspend by the end of the financial
OL,20,Fyear, primarily attributed to rising
OL,21,Fcosts for care services.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,334,330,200,160,0,100
