OL,3,GNEWSAResorts' parking revenue down
OL,4,Adespite busy summer
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe authority's cabinet member for
OL,7,Ffinance, Mike Cox, said good weather
OL,8,Fand high visitor numbers "does not
OL,9,Fautomatically translate into higher
OL,10,Fincome".
